OL,3,GNEWSAHow one grandmother stays positive
OL,4,Adespite three bouts of cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Touch wood, I could live for years,"
OL,7,Fthe 53-year-old said. "We haven't got a
OL,8,Fcrystal ball, they don't know how long
OL,9,FI've got, but if I'm having all of this
OL,10,Ftreatment, I'm heading it straight on,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
